{"task_id": "Mbpp/222", "solution": "def check_type(input_tuple: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if all elements in the tuple have the same data type.\n    Returns True for empty or single-element tuples.\"\"\"\n    if not input_tuple or len(input_tuple) == 1:\n        return True\n\n    first_type = type(input_tuple[0])\n    for element in input_tuple[1:]:\n        if type(element) is not first_type:\n            return False\n    return True"}
